<title>USA: US Transportation sells Automated Solutions.</title>
<headline>US Transportation sells Automated Solutions.</headline>
<dateline>ELMSFORD, N.Y. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Transportation Systems Inc said on Monday that it sold one of its manufacturing subsidiaries, Automated Solutions Inc, to KAC Inc, a privately held, Phoenix-based company, for $6.5 million in cash payable over two years.</p>
<p>U.S. Transportation said that the sale will be reported as a pre-tax gain of slightly more than $1.3 million to be recognized in the first quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
